OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested and charged over
OL,4,Adeath in West Lothian village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 60-year-old man has been arrested and
OL,7,Fcharged over the death of a man in a
OL,8,FWest Lothian village earlier this year.
OL,10,FPolice said a 64-year-old man was found
OL,11,Finjured at a property on Quarry Road,
OL,12,FFauldhouse, at about 10:20 on Tuesday 3
OL,13,FFebruary.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended the
OL,16,Fincident and he was taken to hospital,
OL,17,Fwhere he later died.
OL,19,FPolice Scotland said the arrested man
OL,20,Fwas due to appear at Livingston Sheriff
OL,21,FCourt on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
